 were once  themselves spiral power based creatures  but when they realize that spiral power  has infinite  potential to keep changing and evolving  they concluded that if the power became  overused and misused it could lead to  the destruction of the entire universe  as a result they decided to stop their  own evolution form a collective  consciousness and suppress other species  who were using spiral power now doesn't  the anti spiral collective consciousness  from Gurren Lagann sound a lot like the  representative of collective  consciousness from cold Geass the  representative also did not trust humans  with Geass power just like the anti  spirals did not trust humans with spiral  power and both sides are prepared to  exterminate the entire human race if  that is what is required for the  well-being of the universe so what if  the true identity of the anti spirals is  the collective consciousness from Code  Geass what if the anti spirals are the  ancient Rogner s and what if sometime in  the very distant future humans used and  manipulated Geass power in such a way  that it evolved and became what we know  as spiral power at that point the ragnar  s aka dnt spirals decided to act and  suppress the humans before they used  Geass power aka spiral power to destroy  the universe interestingly enough in  Gurren Lagann the very first villains we  meet are creatures known as beast men  artificially created beings who have  mixed animal and human DNA because they  are artificially created they did not  evolve naturally so they do not possess  spiral power and for this reason they  were used to keep the humans who possess  spiral power in check and we know that  in the seven deadly sins there are  creatures known as beast men - they are  animal and human hybrids like zhivago  who were feared by humans and because  they were so feared by humans they were  also persecuted by them it is as if the  ancient mythology about the seven deadly  sins and the beast men from those  